<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Venom Coat</ansi> mutation

On command, your venom glands flush your skin and weapons with a
slick, burning toxin. For a short while every strike you land carries
its bite.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active (command: <ansi fg="command">venom-coat</ansi>)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Coats your weapons in venom so that, for a short while, your blows
  land with far greater force

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Working up the venom draws on your special-move readiness and
  costs stamina

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
